# Build context for infra/docker/*.Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# Docker only reads .dockerignore at the context root (or <Dockerfile>.dockerignore), so it lives here.

# Secrets: never sent to the builder, never baked into an image.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# VCS, tooling, host-built artefacts (rebuilt inside the image for linux-musl).
.git
.github
.superpowers
**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Not needed to build the apps.
docs
PRD.md
